# Citation metadata for GENOAR (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# GitHub reads this file to offer "Cite this repository".
#
# Still to fill in:
#   - `doi`: the Zenodo DOI of a release, once one is deposited.
#   - `preferred-citation`: swap `status: submitted` for the volume, pages and
#     DOI when the article is published.
# Bump `version` and `date-released` with every tagged release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GENOAR, please cite the article under preferred-citation.
  To cite a specific version of the software, use the release DOI.
type: software
title: "GENOAR: Global Engine for Navigating the Omnicell space via Agent-based Research"
abstract: >-
  An engine for building single-cell transcriptomic atlases that both AI
  agents and human researchers can use: it collects and standardises GEO
  metadata with an AI nomenclaturist, processes the raw reads in parallel,
  and serves the result through an AI librarian.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-22"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cxinsys/genoar"
url: "https://genoar.ai"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - single-cell transcriptomics
  - artificial intelligence
  - agentic AI
  - parallel computing
